# 2. Do Not Pretend Synthetic Data Is Real ETABS Data

Every generated case must identify its provenance.

Use:

```json
{
  "provenance": {
    "type": "synthetic_engineering_benchmark",
    "etabs_verified": false
  }
}
```

Later real ETABS captures may use:

```json
{
  "provenance": {
    "type": "captured_etabs_snapshot",
    "etabs_verified": true,
    "etabs_version": "..."
  }
}
```

Never mix these two categories.

